{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-05-09 09:03:00', 'title': 'PRECISIONAL COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF FOUR INDUSTRIAL TECHNOLOGY BUSINESSES FROM TRIMBLE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PRECISIONAL , AN AFFILIATE OF THE JORDAN COMPANY ("TJC"), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED TRANSACTION TO ACQUIRE FOUR INDUSTRIAL TECHNOLOGY BUSINESSES FROM TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB). THE ACQUIRED BUSINESSES INCLUDE PROTEMPIS (FORMERLY TRIMBLE TIME AND FREQUENCY), LOADRITE, SPECTRA PRECISION TOOLS, AND SECO.'}